# Swahili translation of KUSANYA's UI shell (sidebar, top bar, auth pages).
# See ARCHITECTURE_DECISIONS ADR-038 and docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md for scope.
#
# This file was authored by hand rather than extracted with
# `django-admin makemessages` -- GNU gettext's C tools (msguniq etc.,
# which makemessages shells out to) aren't installed in this
# environment and require system/admin-level installation this
# environment doesn't have. Every msgid below was collected directly
# from the {% trans %}/{% blocktrans %} tags actually present in the
# templates it covers (templates/base.html, base_auth.html,
# partials/sidebar.html, partials/topbar.html,
# partials/language_switcher.html, and every page that extends
# base_auth.html -- accounts/login.html, accounts/mfa_verify.html,
# tenants/onboarding.html) -- not guessed or invented. Form field
# labels (e.g. the onboarding form's per-field labels, which come from
# apps.tenants.forms rather than a template) are a known, separate gap
# -- not covered here. Compiled to the real .mo Django reads via
# `pybabel compile` (pure Python, ships with the `babel` package,
# requires no system gettext either) rather than `compilemessages`.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
